      "operative_body": "That Development Variance Permit No. DVP22-0013 be issued by the Council for the City of Langford to Beedie (Langford Ridge) Holdings Ltd., Inc. No. BC1096234 to allow a two- point turnaround in lieu of a cul-de-sac at 2750 Leigh Road, subject to the following terms and conditions: 1. Variances The following regulation of Subdivision and Development Servicing Bylaw No. 1000 is varied pursuant to section 498 of the Local Government Act: a) That Schedule 4 be varied to allow a permanent two-point turnaround in a statutory right-of way, to be registered at the time of road dedication, in lieu of a cul-de-sac.",
