      "operative_body": "That Temporary Use Permit No. TUP23-0003 be issued by the Council for the City of Langford to Burkhart Construction Management Inc. on behalf of Daniel Graham Winter to operate a standalone daycare at 2773 Strathmore Road, subject to the following terms and conditions: 1. Conditions The following conditions are imposed pursuant to section 493 of the Local Government Act: a) That the group daycare is limited to a capacity of 28 children, and may also be operated as a standalone use without the proprietor of the daycare living on-site; b) That the requirement for a form and character development permit is waived, subject to the applicant altering the land as per the attached site plan; and c) That the applicant makes an application for rezoning within 36 months of issuance of this Temporary Use Permit if they wish to continue this use beyond the three-year term.",
